-- 31. TYPE NODES, DONE — AND THE ITEM WAS TWO ITEMS, which the first probe
-- against the store said and the note did not. It read: "the only question this
-- model asks of a type is which PROTOTYPE a value has, so that `xs.at(-1)` can
-- be attributed to `Array.prototype.at`", and it owned ten deferred TypeScript
-- kinds on the strength of that sentence.
